  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JASPERS advisory support to Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The main objective of the `JASPERS advisory support to Ukraine&#xBF; Action is to provide advisory support to Beneficiaries in Ukraine to help them prepare or implement quality investment projects that are in line with EU and EIB standards. Advisory support offered may span the entire project cycle from sector strategies to project implementation, and includes horizontal support and capacity building activities. Sectors to be covered will include transport, urban regeneration, social housing, environment/ water/ irrigation and solid waste, agrifood, broadband, digital/ telecom and social sectors (health, education). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
